  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### Downloading the App mobile devices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 25 Jul, 2025 at  4:59 PM\n\n\t\tThe Capium 365 mobile app is built to give clients easy and secure access to their financial data—anytime, anywhere. Available on both Android and iOS devices, the app enables seamless collaboration between clients and their accountants, helping users stay connected,Scan and upload receipts or invoices instantly, Link your bank account for live transaction access .\n\n### For iOS (iPhone/iPad) Users:\n\nOpen the App Store on your iPhone or iPad.\n\nUse the search bar to look for \"Capium 365\".\n\nFind the official app by Capium and tap \"Get\" to begin the download.\n\nAfter the app is installed, open it and enter your login credentials from your Capium 365 invitation email.\n\nClick on the link below to learn more about downloading and logging  in to the App (iOS) \n\n https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000267946?portalId=9000044273\n\n###  For Android Users:\n\nOpen the Google Play Store on your Android phone or tablet.\n\nIn the search bar, type \"Capium 365\".\n\nLocate the official Capium 365 app (published by Capium) and tap \"Install\".\n\nOnce installed, open the app and log in using the credentials provided in your invitation email.\n\nIf you haven’t accepted the invitation yet, make sure to complete that step via the link before logging in.\n\nClick on the link below to learn more about downloading and logging in to the App (Android)\n\nhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000270002?portalId=9000044273\n\n### \n\nClick on the link below to learn more about downloading and logging in to the App (IOS) \n\nhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000267946?portalId=9000044273\n\n### \n\n###     \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201790\">Capium 365 (Customer/Client)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Downloading the App mobile devices\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 25 Jul, 2025 at  4:59 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"225\" dir=\"ltr\">The <strong data-end=\"185\" data-start=\"160\">Capium 365 mobile app</strong> is built to give clients easy and secure access to their financial data—anytime, anywhere. Available on both <strong data-end=\"306\" data-start=\"295\">Android</strong> and <strong data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"311\">iOS</strong> devices, the app enables seamless collaboration between clients and their accountants, helping users stay connected,Scan and upload receipts or invoices instantly, Link your bank account for live transaction access .</p><p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"225\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 data-end=\"990\" data-start=\"954\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">For iOS (iPhone/iPad) Users:</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"991\"><li data-end=\"1040\" data-start=\"991\"><p data-end=\"1040\" data-start=\"994\">Open the <strong data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"1003\">App Store</strong> on your iPhone or iPad.</p></li><li data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"1041\"><p data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"1044\">Use the search bar to look for <strong data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1075\">\"Capium 365\"</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1093\"><p data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1096\">Find the official app by Capium and tap <strong data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1136\">\"Get\"</strong> to begin the download.</p></li><li data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1169\"><p data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1172\" dir=\"ltr\">After the app is installed, open it and enter your login credentials from your Capium 365 invitation email.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1283\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Click on the link below to learn more about downloading and</span> logging &nbsp;in to the App (iOS)&nbsp;</p><p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1283\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000267946?portalId=9000044273\">https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000267946?portalId=9000044273</a></p><p><br></p><p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"225\"><br></p><p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"225\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234656318/original/NXAZg34TQsaS-esmiUw0f8ekF4-pUKcVew.png?1753367342\" style=\"width: 209px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234656318\"></p><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1283\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>&nbsp;For Android Users:</strong></h4><p><br></p><ul data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"547\"><li data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"547\"><p data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"550\">Open the <strong data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"559\">Google Play Store</strong> on your Android phone or tablet.</p></li><li data-end=\"658\" data-start=\"614\"><p data-end=\"658\" data-start=\"617\">In the search bar, type <strong data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"641\">\"Capium 365\"</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"659\"><p data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"662\">Locate the official Capium 365 app (published by Capium) and tap <strong data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"727\">\"Install\"</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"742\"><p data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"745\">Once installed, open the app and log in using the credentials provided in your invitation email.</p></li><li data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"842\"><p data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"845\" dir=\"ltr\">If you haven’t accepted the invitation yet, make sure to complete that step via the link before logging in.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"845\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Click on the link below to learn more about downloading and</span> logging in to the App (Android)</p><p data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"845\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000270002?portalId=9000044273\" target=\"_self\">https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000270002?portalId=9000044273</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234656356/original/49fhzYMScnHC-qkhPX-FmKqycE5lfBz5GQ.png?1753367363\" style=\"width: 243px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234656356\"></p><h4 data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></h4><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start; display: inline !important;\">Click on the link below to learn more about downloading and</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orpha